OL,3,GNEWSAMorgan Gibbs-White fined after his
OL,4,Acar ran red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland and Nottingham Forest attacking
OL,7,Fmidfielder Morgan Gibbs-White has been
OL,8,Fhanded a #1,000 court bill after his
OL,9,FRange Rover was caught running a red
OL,10,Flight.
OL,12,FThe 26-year-old's vehicle was caught on
OL,13,Fcamera going past a set of lights in
OL,14,FWest Bridgford, Nottinghamshire, 1.1
OL,15,Fseconds after they turned red.
OL,17,FGibbs-White, who earned his first
OL,18,FEngland cap in 2024, failed to respond
OL,19,Fto two police letters asking him to
OL,20,Fconfirm if he had been driving at the
OL,21,Ftime of the red light offence,
OL,22,Faccording to court documents.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
