OL,3,GNEWSAMorgan Gibbs-White fined after his
OL,4,Acar ran red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast Tuesday, he was convicted by a
OL,7,Fcourt of failing to provide the
OL,8,Fidentity of a driver at the time of an
OL,9,Foffence.
